        "description": "Lumivista is a theme inspired by the magic of the Northern Lights, combining vibrant shades of pink, black and purple with a mystical and ethereal touch. The immersive atmosphere is reminiscent of the celestial glow of the Northern Lights, evoking feelings of mystery, tranquility and connection with nature. Ideal for projects seeking a sophisticated, futuristic and fascinating look."
